This recipe is MIT, like the rest of the repository, except
scripts/download_snapshot.py, which carries its own AGPL-3.0-or-later header.

It is a port of tonyd2wild/Inkling-2-Mini-NVFP4-DGX-Spark
(https://github.com/tonyd2wild/Inkling-2-Mini-NVFP4-DGX-Spark, commit 300942d):
its launch flags, tier sizing and memory findings shape profiles.sh, start.sh
and preflight.sh, and scripts/sanity.py is its sanity.py with the default port
changed. Upstream's notice follows.

